  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/compatible_with-26.2_|_26.1_|_1.21_|_1.20_|_1.19_|_1.18_|_1.17_|_1.16-blue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"514\" height=\"28\"></p>\n<h1><strong>更美的灯笼 v1.3</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>现已兼容新的铜灯笼和铁链！</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>本资源包通过赋予<strong>灯笼</strong>和<strong>铁链</strong><strong>3D模型</strong>以及焕然一新的外观，改变了它们的样式。此外，它还优化了<strong>第三人称视角</strong>下<strong>手持</strong>灯笼的方式，使其更加美观且略带真实感。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/614/321/huge_2023-01-29_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1342/436/2025-09-30_20-02-52-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/711/589/huge_2023-01-29_19.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\"></p>\n<h2><strong>🌟模组支持（从 1.2 版本及以上开始）</strong></h2>\n<hr>\n<table style=\"width:23.6842%;border-width:1px\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong>模组</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\"><strong>1.20</strong></th>\n<th style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\"><strong>1.21</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong><a rel=\"nofollow\">神秘灯笼 (Arcane Lanterns)</a></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:64.5587%;border-width:1px\"><strong><a rel=\"nofollow\">稀薄空气 (Thin Air)</a></strong></td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n<td style=\"width:17.4355%;border-width:1px\">✅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>🔻1.2 版本及更早版本</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/compatible_with-1.21_|_